<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Social-Network on 0x32++</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/social-network/</link><description>Recent content in Social-Network on 0x32++</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 01 Jul 2011 10:50:00 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/social-network/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Google Plus</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/google-plus/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Jul 2011 10:50:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/google-plus/</guid><description>&lt;div dir="ltr" style="text-align: left;" trbidi="on"&gt;Having my first look at Google+, so far looks nice.&lt;br /&gt;&#10;Need to figure out if you can get a RSS feed of the items you've +'ed?&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/5890569192/" title="Having a play with Google+ by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm6.static.flickr.com/5231/5890569192_465892e55e_z.jpg" width="640" height="424" alt="Having a play with Google+"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;a href="http://meekgonkey.blogspot.com/"&gt;Doodle's Geek Monkey&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="http://twitter.com/alastair_hm"&gt;Alastair Montgomery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Social Network Status Generator</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/bloglines-social-network-status/</link><pubDate>Mon, 17 Nov 2008 12:16:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/bloglines-social-network-status/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; 18 of this post&amp;rsquo;s 30 links are now broken — mostly dead 2008–2013 feed-syndication infrastructure (FeedBurner, Gawker, AOL&amp;rsquo;s old blog network, Pheedo, Yahoo Pipes). Left as originally published.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.bloglines.com/"&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;table width="100%"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt; &lt;a name="base9477167"&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;table id="table9477167" bg="" style="color: rgb(189, 224, 237);" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" width="100%"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt; &lt;td rowspan="2"&gt; &lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt; &lt;span class="blogtitle"&gt;&lt;a href="http://pipes.yahoo.com/pipes/pipe.info?_id=8IsQFi282xG5FaTJJjBjOg"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Life GH Com&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Pipes Output &lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt; &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;a name="base9477167"&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt; &lt;div id="items9477167" style="display: block;"&gt; &lt;table width="100%"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr bgcolor="#ffffff"&gt; &lt;td&gt; &lt;table width="100%"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a title="Site: Life GH Com" href="http://www.ghacks.net/2008/11/17/social-network-status-generator/"&gt;Social Network Status Generator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have we come this far already? Desperate times require desperate measures it seems. To impress, one has to be witty. This is especially hard on social networks with millions of other users who want to impress as well.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;According to the developers of &lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://generatus.com/"&gt;Generatus&lt;/a&gt; their product is ideal for the imaginatively challenged. Generatus is a social network status generator which turns the overly repeated and boring statuses like &amp;ldquo;Martin is working&amp;rdquo;, &amp;ldquo;Drinking Coffee&amp;rdquo; or &amp;ldquo;Jim is visiting his grandparents&amp;rdquo; into something witty and original.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Simplicity was probably the main design idea behind Generatus. Males can simply hit the Generate button while females will have to click on the female to generate female statuses (not sure if there is really that much difference to justify that, it is probably used to make use of the right grammatical person in the sentences). It is also possible to use tags to get a status that relates to the selected tags.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;img src="http://www.ghacks.net/wp-content/uploads/2008/11/generatus-499x337.jpg" alt="" title="generatus" class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-8329" width="499" height="337" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The program generates statuses like &amp;ldquo;Fred missed winning the lottery by only SIX numbers&amp;rdquo;, &amp;ldquo;Fred was schizophrenic once, but we&amp;rsquo;re better now!&amp;rdquo; or &amp;ldquo;Susi is pushing up daises&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Judging from those &amp;ldquo;witty&amp;rdquo; statuses it is probably fair to assume that Generatus aims at the school - college kid fraction of the population. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/2008/11/17/social-network-status-generator/"&gt;Social Network Status Generator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; Tags: &lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/tag/facebook/" title="facebook"&gt;facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/tag/facebook-status/" title="facebook status"&gt;facebook status&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/tag/generatus/" title="generatus"&gt;generatus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/tag/myspace/" title="myspace"&gt;myspace&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/tag/status-generator/" title="status generator"&gt;status generator&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/tag/twitter/" title="twitter"&gt;twitter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/tag/twitter-status/" title="twitter status"&gt;twitter status&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/tag/web-services/" title="web services"&gt;web services&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Related posts&lt;/h4&gt; &lt;ul class="st-related-posts"&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/2008/11/15/windows-live-photo-gallery-facebook-plugin/" title="Windows Live Photo Gallery Facebook Plugin (November 15, 2008)"&gt;Windows Live Photo Gallery Facebook Plugin&lt;/a&gt; (2)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/2008/11/11/video-crawler-a-multimedia-search-engine/" title="Video Crawler - A Multimedia Search Engine (November 11, 2008)"&gt;Video Crawler - A Multimedia Search Engine&lt;/a&gt; (2)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/2008/10/27/joe-anderson-a-belated-introduction/" title="Joe Anderson: A belated introduction (October 27, 2008)"&gt;Joe Anderson: A belated introduction&lt;/a&gt; (7)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/2008/10/26/publish-rss-news-feeds-on-twitter/" title="Publish RSS News Feeds On Twitter (October 26, 2008)"&gt;Publish RSS News Feeds On Twitter&lt;/a&gt; (4)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://www.ghacks.net/2008/09/30/flickr-tools-tag-galaxy/" title="Flickr Tools Tag Galaxy (September 30, 2008)"&gt;Flickr Tools Tag Galaxy&lt;/a&gt; (1)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="feedflare"&gt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://feedproxy.google.com/%7Ef/Ghacksnet?a=GvE2CRyk"&gt;&lt;img src="http://feedproxy.google.com/%7Ef/Ghacksnet?d=41" border="0" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://feedproxy.google.com/%7Ef/Ghacksnet?a=GrnxFY2Z"&gt;&lt;img src="http://feedproxy.google.com/%7Ef/Ghacksnet?i=GrnxFY2Z" border="0" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://feedproxy.google.com/%7Ef/Ghacksnet?a=bLIbRB8R"&gt;&lt;img src="http://feedproxy.google.com/%7Ef/Ghacksnet?i=bLIbRB8R" border="0" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://feedproxy.google.com/%7Ef/Ghacksnet?a=mGNQMjYH"&gt;&lt;img src="http://feedproxy.google.com/%7Ef/Ghacksnet?i=mGNQMjYH" border="0" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://feedproxy.google.com/%7Ef/Ghacksnet?a=h7UprZxB"&gt;&lt;img src="http://feedproxy.google.com/%7Ef/Ghacksnet?d=52" border="0" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="http://feedproxy.google.com/%7Ef/Ghacksnet?a=gdzznA4m"&gt;&lt;img src="http://feedproxy.google.com/%7Ef/Ghacksnet?i=gdzznA4m" border="0" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align="left" valign="top"&gt; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td align="right" valign="top"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>